# armour/<body>/skirt_bell: BELL, a kusazuri of two lacquered lames flaring from the belt to 5 px past the
# hips each side, a metal-2 lacing row between the lames (N: one iridescent band a lame), R on the hem lip;
# its dark rim continues behind the legs (skirt_bell_back), so the lampshade outline reads beside the boots.
# Generated from the FORGE-LIMBS skirt templates (gen_skirts2.py, skirts_def.py; iteration 2: the D view serves U, `tags anyfacing`); Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role overlay skirt.bell
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys hang
tags anyfacing
z 10

